    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d56">

                <pb facs="0201" n="77" sameAs="frus:frus1881/pg77"/>

                <head>No. 56.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adams to Mr. Evarts</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">La
                                Paz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1880-11-17"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 17, 1880</date>. (Received
                        January 3, 1881.)</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to transmit herewith a
                    copy of a note received from Señor Carrillo, and one of the printed pamphlets
                    mentioned therein, containing the report of the Bolivian plenipotentiaries, the
                    protocols of the conferences and the acknowledgment of the government.</p>
                <p>Inasmuch as a translation of the protocols will be furnished by Mr. Christiancy,
                    I transmit herewith only that of the report itself.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>CHARLES ADAMS.</signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d56-a1.xml" xpointer="d56-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d56-a2.xml" xpointer="d56-a2"/>
